        <briefdescription>
<para>Allocate a packet. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>If a buffer is configured to overwrite mode then if there is no space to allocate a new buffer, oldest packets are dropped. Otherwise allocation fails and null pointer is returned.</para>
